==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|carpentrie|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|carpenterie|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|ONF.|en}} (compare French {{term|charpenterie|lang=fr}}). See [[carpenter]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~|carpentries}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} The trade of cutting and joining [[timber]] in order to construct [[building]]s or other structures; [[woodworking]]
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A [[carpenter]]'s [[workshop]].

